␀ms␀-a-zA-Z0-9_./¿-÷ÿ-ˆ¯-ˇ␀123␀  Valid options are (not all of them are implemented)
    -a accel         sets the acceleration (default %d)
    -b baud-rate     sets the baud rate (default %d)
    -B sequence      allows changing the buttons (default '%s')
    -d delta         sets the delta value (default %d)
    -D               dirty operation (debug only)
    -i interval      max time interval for multiple clicks (default %i)
    -k               kill a running gpm, to start X with a busmouse
    -l charset       loads the inword() LUT (default '%s')
    -L charset       load LUT and exit
    -m mouse-device  sets mouse device
    -o modem-lines   toggle modem lines ("dtr", "rts", "both")
    -p               draw the pointer while striking a selection
    -P               do it only with word and line drags
    -r number        sets the responsiveness (default %i)
    -s sample-rate   sets the sample rate (default %d)
    -t mouse-type    sets mouse type (default '%s')
                     Microsoft = `ms', Mouse Systems Corp = `msc',
                     MM Series = `mm', Logitech = `logi', BusMouse = `bm',
                     MSC 3-bytes = `sun', PS/2 = `ps2')
                     MouseMan = `mman', oldest 2-button serial = `bare'
    -T               test: read mouse, no clients
    -v               print version info and exit
