><H1
><A
NAME="WEBMASTERING"
></A
>Chapter 5. Webmastering</H1
><DIV
CLASS="SECTION"
><H1
CLASS="SECTION"
><A
NAME="PROJECT-WEBSPACE"
>5.1. Bochs project webspace</A
></H1
><P
>The Bochs project webspace is stored under the SF directory <TT
CLASS="FILENAME"
>/home/project-web/bochs</TT
>.
It can be accessed from the SF shell using SSH or with the commands <B
CLASS="COMMAND"
>sftp</B
>,
<B
CLASS="COMMAND"
>scp</B
> and <B
CLASS="COMMAND"
>rsync</B
>. Some parts of the directory
structure must be updated from the local CVS repository, others from Bochs SVN
(directories <TT
CLASS="FILENAME"
>bochs</TT
> and <TT
CLASS="FILENAME"
>sfsite</TT
>).
The online documentation, disk images and screenshots must be uploaded manually.
<DIV
CLASS="TABLE"
><A
NAME="AEN1615"
></A
><P
><B
>Table 5-1. Directory structure</B
></P
><TABLE
BORDER="1"
CLASS="CALSTABLE"
><COL><COL><THEAD
><TR
><TH
>Location</TH
><TH
>Meaning</TH
></TR
></THEAD
><TBODY
><TR
><TD
>cgi-bin</TD
><TD
>CGI scripts for the website</TD
></TR
><TR
><TD
>htdocs</TD
><TD
>root directory of the website</TD
></TR
><TR
><TD
>htdocs/doc/docbook</TD
><TD
>Bochs online documentation</TD
></TR
><TR
><TD
>htdocs/docs-html</TD
><TD
>old Bochs documentation</TD
></TR
><TR
><TD
>htdocs/guestos</TD
><TD
>disk images directly stored on the Bochs website</TD
></TR
><TR
><TD
>htdocs/screenshot</TD
><TD
>screenshots of Bochs running several guest operating systems</TD
></TR
><TR
><TD
>htdocs/svn-snapshot</TD
><TD
>link to current snapshot</TD
></TR
