␀␀Bt␀m␀l␀␀␀ˇˇ␀␀ˇˇˇˇˇˇˇˇˇˇˇˇ␀␀ˇˇˇˇs␀e␀r␀i␀a␀␀␀l␀-␀p␀o␀r␀t␀␀␀.␀h␀SERIAL~1HTM ␀ßatÀZÀZ␀Cx$P‘j©␀␀As␀e␀t␀u␀p␀␀.␀h␀t␀m␀l␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇˇˇSETUP~1 HTM ␀®atÀZÀZ␀Cx$P÷j≥␀␀As␀m␀p␀.␀h␀␀t␀m␀l␀␀␀ˇˇˇˇ␀␀ˇˇˇˇSMP~1   HTM ␀´atÀZÀZ␀Cx$Pÿj␀␀Bt␀f␀o␀r␀m␀␀Ös␀.␀h␀t␀m␀l␀␀␀␀␀ˇˇs␀u␀p␀p␀o␀␀Ör␀t␀e␀d␀-␀p␀␀␀l␀a␀<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/loose.dtd">
