><SPAN
CLASS="footnote"
>[1]</SPAN
></A
></TD
><TD
ALIGN="LEFT"
VALIGN="TOP"
WIDTH="95%"
><P
>IPS measurements depend on
OS and compiler configuration in addition to host processor clock
speed.</P
></TD
></TR
></TABLE
