CLASS="SECTION"
><H1
CLASS="SECTION"
><A
NAME="MTOOLS"
>8.3. Use mtools to manipulate disk images</A
></H1
><P
>Mtools is a set of programs that can read, write, and format DOS disk images.
There are links to the Mtools main page and a Win32 port of Mtools on the
<A
HREF="http://bochs.sourceforge.net/links.html"
TARGET="_top"
>Bochs Links page</A
>,
under Resources.</P
><P
>The mtools web site has a detailed manual.  If anyone wants to write
instructions specific to Bochs, we can add it right here.</P
></DIV
