>Chapter 2. Release Notes</H1
><P
>The change log is stored in the Bochs source code in a file called
CHANGES.  Click <A
HREF="http://svn.code.sf.net/p/bochs/code/trunk/bochs/CHANGES"
TARGET="_top"
>here</A
>
to see the latest version of the CHANGES file.</P
><P
